{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近学校のみんなの間で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なめこるとかゆー動詞が使われてる(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前原宿行った時も、なめこだらけでびっくりしたもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なめこ。なめこブームなんか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はなめこの時代なんか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なめこ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、今気付くって時点でだいぶ遅れてるよ中元さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こーゆーの疎いの('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に中元さんが気付いたってことはかなり世の中に浸透してんのね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい骨痛治りました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでかね。久々に筋肉使うと筋肉痛なるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段骨使ってないと骨痛になるんかね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"骨痛て(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当に心配してくれたみなさんありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今体力測定しててね。毎日悲惨なよ本当に!やー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう元気。もう元気よー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はばりばり踊るけえね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。明日!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジアムライブin埼玉!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は埼玉にお邪魔しますよ(*^^*)埼玉県民さん初めましてですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん個人的な話、お仕事で埼玉行くのは初めてよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティッシュとか、握手会とか、乃木坂さんよくお邪魔してるんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乃木坂の中元日芽香は初めてです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブもだけど、試合もスリリングでね。見るの好きになった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみやあっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞーおー(`・ω・')!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月21日誕生日だけど誰か「おめでとう」って言ってくれるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとーう＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが言いますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な1年にして下さいねっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉県といったら思い浮べるもの、イメージは、何でしょうか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉(岩瀬佑美子chan)さゆにゃん(井上小百合chan)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)かなりん(中田花奈chan)は埼玉出身だったよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも名物とか全然わからんっ。何ー誰か教えてー?るんるーん???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにお願い&アドバイス。...(中略)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから「かわいい!」っていわれたら「ありがと!!」て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってくれると嬉しいんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部読みました。ありがとうございます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは素直にみなさんの意見を聞き入れて頷けるように頑張るね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでそんな可愛いんだい?好きな言葉がちくわ一会だから?('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいありがとうございます(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく。アドバイス通りにしてみたよ。んんん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは絶叫大丈夫な人だっけ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんホラーとかいける?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶叫系の乗り物って、好きですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホラーも絶叫も好きっ(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かもんかもん。一緒に行こーう!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーランドは行ったことありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーは幼かったから記憶がない('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランドは行ったの去年だもん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子のサイズ、Sでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子ー???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いことかぶってないわあ(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バスケ経験者なら当然スラムダンクは読んでるよな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、全巻持ってるから貸そうか?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スラムダンク...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前しか存じ上げません...(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースは読んでるかな?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースも読んだことないのよーきゃーごめんなさーい☆!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家でも甘えん坊キャラなの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家こそって感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままとわちゃわちゃ戯れてますっ∪・ω・∪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい学校の制服かわいい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん。可愛いっ(*^^*)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて会った人とかどうやって仲良くなる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやったらいっぱい友達ができますかね??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの場合、初めましての瞬間からうるさいけえなあ。わらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔でいればすーぐ仲良くなれるとひめたんは思います(^^)笑顔大事よ笑顔っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーしたら笑顔出せますかね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも自分の笑顔が嫌いな人だからねー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちはわかっても、なんかいい事言えない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識してたら固い笑顔になっちゃうから、もっと楽しいこと考えたりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素直に笑ってみてはいかが??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薄いピンクがほとんどだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは薄いピンクかそれとも濃いピンクかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンク以外に好きな色はあるのカナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の質問は、ひめたんの好みを答えればいいんかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも好きよお(*^^*)どぎついピンクは目がちかちかして苦手かもしれん←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パステルカラーなら基本何でも好き☆!きれいっしょ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/21/3755333/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけは治したい自分の恥ずかしくて困ってるクセはある?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そゆのは恥ずかしいから答えない(*/ω＼*)とかゆーて。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}